OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for padel courts at college
OL,4,Agiven go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a padel facility in
OL,7,FLoughborough have been given the go
OL,8,Fahead.
OL,10,FCharnwood Borough Council has approved
OL,11,Fa planning application from the David
OL,12,FRoss Education Trust to construct six
OL,13,Fpadel courts at Charnwood College.
OL,15,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,16,Fproposals would provide a
OL,17,F"high-quality, all-weather facility" to
OL,18,Fsupport the college, and would be hired
OL,19,Fout during week nights and weekends.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
